  "rulesText": "Rules and Regulations\n•Top 7 Scores for final total, count back decided on 8th score and so on. (Still level, then most appearances wins)\n•Any player scoring 40+ points will be cut a further shot\n•All winners will be cut 2 shots (Majors), (1 shot in monthly medal with 9 players or more)\n•Anyone failing to comply with any R&A rule will result in a two shot penalty.\n•In the event of a tie the result will be decided on a “count back” Starting from Stroke Index one on the final day (All competitions)\n•At Majors, In the event of no second round, it will become a one round competition."
